  "implemented": [
    "Complete bounded registered population; independent outcome, governing semantics, support drift/unknown/review/supersession, explicit accounting, readiness and historical/current conclusion meaning.",
    "Rationale-bearing choices and selected/historical/superseded decisions for every execution. New unassessed activities require fresh accounting; unselected historical support drift alone does not retire selected passing evidence.",
    "Guarded atomic selection/conclusion/reopen/revise operations through core, typed HTTP/client and CLI, plus existing UI outcome inspection. Exact recovery remains before current guards, with no implicit retries.",
    "Exact state references, absences and applicable review IDs in controlled selections. Pinned policy permits assessed design changes only where known and explicitly accepted; governing criteria/method changes cannot be reviewed away.",
    "Typed immutable conclusion and explicit reopening/basis lineage; unchanged mapped criteria may reuse original execution, changed criterion/statement/method semantics require new execution. Self-changing support and post-journal failures roll back all native/evidence/outcome state.",
    "Common bounded fact capture/digests extracted from assessment ownership; no new structural primitive, storage migration, external source IO or rule framework."
  ],
